      "after": {
        "zh": "\\[I=\\mathcal F_y^{-1}(\\mathcal F_x^{-1}(X))\\]\n\n沿一轴重建后，结果仍可能有实部和虚部，另一轴要一起读。逐行重建采用直接求和，补回前向归一化。",
        "en": "\\[I=\\mathcal F_y^{-1}(\\mathcal F_x^{-1}(X))\\]\n\nAfter reconstructing along one axis, retain both components for the other. Row synthesis sums directly to undo the forward normalisation."
